+| file (studio/…) | #1656 proposed | open main now | satellite now |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| src/utils/api.ts | +9 lines | **all 9 present** | identical to open |
+| src/components/auth/ServiceHealthBar.tsx (+test) | mirror | identical | identical |
+| src/services/apiClient.ts (+test) | mirror | identical | identical |
+| package.json | 3-way merge | identical | identical |
+
+Direction of convergence: the satellite's own HEAD carries the sync-bot
+marker (sync open-to-supremeai-studio, latest commit dated 2026-10-27T23:58:59Z,
+landing #1827's pnpm-lock fix), i.e. the mirror is the sync SOURCE and the
+satellite follows it. Somewhere between run-6 and the last sync, the drifted
+files converged on the open side (later studio PRs and/or the sync lane), so
+by the time of this sweep both sides agree byte-for-byte. Filing the rescue
+would have duplicated already-landed work — the verify-first step caught it.
